  "localizations": {
    "desc": {
      "ko": "\uC790\uC2E0\uC758 \uC8FC\uBCC0\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9\uC744 \uB9CC\uB4ED\uB2C8\uB2E4\r\n#{buff_tooltip}\r\n\uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 \uC740\uC2E0 \uAC10\uC9C0 \uAC70\uB9AC\uAC00 |cFFFF9C2750%|r \uC99D\uAC00\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4",
      "en_us": "Creates a protective ward around the caster, this ability has been modified as a test. #{buff_tooltip} Increases stealth detection |cFFFF9C27\u002B200%|r.",
      "zh_cn": "",
      "ja": "",
      "ru": "",
      "zh_tw": "",
      "de": "Erzeugt einen Schutzbann um den Wirker. #{buff_tooltip} Erh\u00F6ht die Tarnungs-Erkennung |cFFFF9C27\u002B200%|r.",
      "fr": "Cr\u00E9e un glyphe protecteur autour du lanceur. #{buff_tooltip} Augmente la d\u00E9tection de la furtivit\u00E9 de |cFFFF9C27200%|r."
    },
    "name": {
      "ko": "\uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9",
      "en_us": "Insulating Lens",
      "zh_cn": "",
      "ja": "",
      "ru": "",
      "zh_tw": "",
      "de": "Isolierlinse",
      "fr": "Couche protectrice"
    },
    "web_desc": {
      "ko": "\uC790\uC2E0\uC758 \uC8FC\uBCC0\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9\uC744 \uB9CC\uB4ED\uB2C8\uB2E4\r\n\uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9\uC740 \uB118\uC5B4\uC9D0 \uD6A8\uACFC\uB97C \uB9C9\uC544\uC8FC\uACE0 [\uD53C\uD574\uB7C9]\uC758 \uD53C\uD574\uB97C \uD761\uC218\uD558\uBA74 \uC0AC\uB77C\uC9C0\uBA70 \uBB3C\uB9AC \uBC29\uC5B4\uB3C4 [\uC99D\uAC00\uB7C9]\uC744 \uC99D\uAC00\uC2DC\uD0B5\uB2C8\uB2E4\r\n\uBCF4\uD638\uB9C9 \uC0C1\uD0DC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 \uC740\uC2E0 \uAC10\uC9C0 \uAC70\uB9AC\uAC00 50% \uC99D\uAC00\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4",
      "en_us": "Creates a protective ward around the caster.\nProtects against the Tripped effect, and increases Physical Defense \u002B[increase]. Disappears after absorbing [damage] damage.\nIncreases stealth detection distance \u002B50%.",
      "zh_cn": "",
      "ja": "",
      "ru": "",
      "zh_tw": "",
      "de": "Erzeugt einen Schutzbann um den Wirker.\nSch\u00FCtzt vor Stolpern und erh\u00F6ht die K\u00F6rperliche Abwehr \u002B[increase]. Verschwindet nach der Absorption von [damage] Schaden.\nErh\u00F6ht die Reichweite der Tarnungs-Erkennung \u002B50%.",
      "fr": "Cr\u00E9e un glyphe protecteur autour du lanceur.\nProt\u00E8ge contre l\u0027effet Tr\u00E9buchement et augmente la d\u00E9fense physique de [increase]. Dispara\u00EEt apr\u00E8s absorption de [damage]\u00A0points de d\u00E9g\u00E2ts.\nAugmente la d\u00E9tection de la furtivit\u00E9 de 50%."
    }
  },
